<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI22-IMPORTANT-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI22-IMPORTANT-002" ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-07-25T06:42:14Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AICH-S2 ;
  triage:title "No unified provenance validator -- ingress/host-authentication checks are duplicated and can drift across call sites" ;
  triage:description "Provenance/authentication checks for authenticated_source_host, origin_message_id, and target.host are each re-implemented ad hoc at multiple call sites (validate_non_self_recipient in send/mod.rs, the AuthenticatedIngress match arms in runtime_health.rs DaemonRequestDispatcher::route, resolve_write_recipient_snapshot in delivery_policy.rs, resolve_acknowledgement_write in ack/mod.rs) rather than going through one shared validator, making it easy for one call site (e.g. the Local ingress arm, see AI22-BLOCK-003) to silently diverge from the others. Found by ruthless-boundary-qa (RBQA-F004, Important)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "workspace" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:category "structure" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-24T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-07-26T21:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Crimson-2f4c fixed on fix/close-out-pre-ai27-findings @ a5659742 (PR #656). New crates/atm-core/src/provenance.rs::validate_write_provenance is the single shared validator, independently confirmed as consumed at all 4 originally-cited sites: send/mod.rs (validate_non_self_recipient), ack/mod.rs (resolve_acknowledgement_write), delivery_policy.rs (consumes the validated ValidatedWriteProvenance result), runtime_health.rs (AuthenticatedIngress arms, ApiRouter::route). Grepped all 4 files for the old ad hoc inline checks (authenticated_source_host.is_some(), origin_message_id/origin_timestamp pairing) -- none remain. ruthless-boundary-qa independently confirmed this is a correct single-owner consolidation with no new cross-crate coupling. CI green (8/8)." ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-002/preai27-a5659742> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-002/s24/send-mod-759> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-002/s24/ack-mod-422> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-002/s24/runtime-health-957> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI22-IMPORTANT-002/s24/delivery-policy-354> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/integrate-AI/e52fffb6> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s21pre/42fbd9fa> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s22/a5aa6813> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s23/b88ca016> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s24/fc9832b3> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s24/fc9832b3> .

